	(lib_symbols)
	(text_box "Changes\n-[x] add power switch(manual plus an sense of if the cloth is connected)\n-[ ] think through wiring better (add mini jst connectors for batt and sense)\n-[ ] add label to battery terminals\n-[ ] use standard 2.54mm sized holes\n-[x] Removed or up voltage on ESD diode on sensor input. the 3v3 casues issues\n-[x] Buy several different sensor resistors or reduce (500k is likely too high)\n-[x] Improve ESD protection\n	- No need, exposed metal parts are alredy protected\n-[ ] add flex in the line mounting clips to suit metal washing racks\n-[x] add status LED\n-[x] add humidity and temp sensor (may be used for better k estimation)"
